{"unit_id":"motionalpha84__dsh-model-check#feature-1","repo":"motionalpha84/dsh-model-check","commit":"191ef9ea31d667ba99e2510d268655d27b49b3ec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Model Check 的功能「指纹候选与糖果联合检测」：完成一轮聊天后，可并行运行三次数字指纹采样和糖果题测评，界面显示候选概率、有效样本和糖果命中。可从联合检测按钮启动，也可设置自动频率。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/monitor.mjs:470-504","src/monitor.mjs:192-227","src/client.js:773-795"]}
